  "goodToKnow": "Vergebens means in vain: vergebens warten, Alles war vergebens. It's used as an adverb or after sein, not before nouns; for that, use vergeblich: eine vergebliche Suche. Umsonst also means in vain, and free of charge. Don't confuse it with vergeben (to forgive, to award): Die Stelle ist schon vergeben (the job is already taken)."
